# Why Claude, run once on its own to suggest a name, gave no answer.

error-one-shot-cancelled = Claude was stopped
error-one-shot-empty = Claude answered nothing
error-one-shot-failed = Claude stopped with an error
error-one-shot-no-agent = Claude is not installed on this computer
error-one-shot-start = Claude could not start
error-one-shot-timed-out = Claude took too long to answer
